WEBVTT

1
00:00:16.012 --> 00:00:20.255
a few tries, Ben managed to slip through the walls of People Place Hospital.

2
00:00:22.937 --> 00:00:26.640
Down a corridor he spotted the mayor talking with news reporters.

3
00:00:27.581 --> 00:00:30.944
They all stood outside two hospital rooms that were sealed shut.

4
00:00:31.824 --> 00:00:33.546
Danger signs hung on the doors.

5
00:00:33.566 --> 00:00:36.968
"Mayor Hubbletree," said a reporter.

6
00:00:36.988 --> 00:00:40.390
"Is it true that this disease started with the monsters?"

7
00:00:41.511 --> 00:00:42.892
"Yes," said the mayor.

8
00:00:42.912 --> 00:00:44.213
"But don't worry.

9
00:00:44.313 --> 00:00:47.775
I'm building a large wall between People Place and Monsterville."

10
00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:50.097
"How is Mrs.

11
00:00:50.157 --> 00:00:52.399
Hubbletree?" asked another reporter.

12
00:00:52.419 --> 00:00:58.083
"Dave and my wife are both in very serious condition," said the mayor gravely.

13
00:00:58.103 --> 00:01:03.122
"This is a very—" Just then the door of one room flew open.

14
00:01:04.223 --> 00:01:06.765
Mrs. Hubbletree stood there in a hospital gown.

15
00:01:07.626 --> 00:01:09.227
She glowered at her husband.

16
00:01:09.908 --> 00:01:10.809
"I'm not sick!"

17
00:01:12.050 --> 00:01:13.571
She held out her purple arms.

18
00:01:13.591 --> 00:01:16.713
"In fact, I like being purple!

19
00:01:18.174 --> 00:01:21.998
It reminds me of the wonderful time I had at the Monster Mash dance."

20
00:01:23.259 --> 00:01:25.060
Dave appeared in the second doorway.

21
00:01:25.080 --> 00:01:27.342
"I feel fine too!

22
00:01:27.822 --> 00:01:29.684
I don't know why I'm in this dumb hospital."

23
00:01:30.700 --> 00:01:34.661
The reporters' cameras flashed, and they all began shouting questions.

24
00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.022
The mayor waved his arms in a panic.

25
00:01:38.042 --> 00:01:40.423
"Get back in that room at once!

26
00:01:40.743 --> 00:01:43.524
You're—" "They probably do feel fine!"

27
00:01:43.904 --> 00:01:44.724
Ben blurted out.

28
00:01:45.524 --> 00:01:47.065
Everyone turned and gasped.

29
00:01:47.865 --> 00:01:50.325
"A ghost!"

30
00:01:51.046 --> 00:01:51.906
cried a reporter.

31
00:01:51.926 --> 00:01:54.567
"Nobody's sick," said Ben.

32
00:01:56.107 --> 00:01:59.708
"The epidemic was caused by a talk potion my friend was making.

33
00:02:01.092 --> 00:02:03.913
Somebody tampered with it and—" "It was me!"

34
00:02:04.474 --> 00:02:05.274
shouted Dave.

35
00:02:05.294 --> 00:02:08.735
"What?" Mayor Hubbletree spun around.

36
00:02:08.755 --> 00:02:10.556
"I didn't mean to!"

37
00:02:10.996 --> 00:02:12.417
Dave's words rushed out.

38
00:02:12.437 --> 00:02:16.819
"I was curious about monsters, so I wandered around Monster Academy.

39
00:02:18.239 --> 00:02:21.141
I saw the experiment and started playing around with the test tubes.

40
00:02:27.143 --> 00:02:28.424
I didn't want to get in trouble.

41
00:02:30.064 --> 00:02:34.386
So I locked that ghost and a wizard in the lab and then ran back toward the gym.

42
00:02:34.886 --> 00:02:39.068
But I got lost and As Dave continued to talk, Mrs.

43
00:02:39.088 --> 00:02:40.788
Hubbletree started talking too.

44
00:02:40.808 --> 00:02:44.990
"Monster Academy is absolutely lovely," she said.

45
00:02:45.010 --> 00:02:48.231
"Everyone there is so interesting!"

46
00:02:49.132 --> 00:02:50.552
Both patients chattered on.

47
00:02:52.293 --> 00:02:54.794
Suddenly Ben felt a strong urge to talk.

48
00:02:54.814 --> 00:02:59.116
"I'm so glad you guys liked Monster Academy," he said.

49
00:03:00.072 --> 00:03:00.773
"I love it there!"

50
00:03:01.133 --> 00:03:02.454
Ben rambled on and on.

51
00:03:02.474 --> 00:03:06.676
"Huh?" Mayor Hubbletree scratched his head.

52
00:03:10.298 --> 00:03:15.001
A little while later, Ben got out of a long car in front of Monster Academy.

53
00:03:15.902 --> 00:03:18.623
He was still chattering away about Monster Academy.

54
00:03:19.284 --> 00:03:22.306
Ben was followed by Dave, who was talking about Jen.

55
00:03:23.446 --> 00:03:24.427
Mayor and Mrs.

56
00:03:24.487 --> 00:03:26.008
Hubbletree climbed out next.

57
00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.122
Mrs. Hubbletree was telling the mayor about her favorite dance moves.

58
00:03:32.362 --> 00:03:35.683
When they opened the school doors, they heard a roar of voices.

59
00:03:36.584 --> 00:03:38.485
Everybody inside was talking too!

60
00:03:38.505 --> 00:03:44.807
"The first monsters arrived in 1493," said Mr.

61
00:03:44.867 --> 00:03:52.290
Freaky. "My family took a broom-flying trip across France last summer," said a witch to nobody in particular.

62
00:03:56.904 --> 00:03:59.026
Mayor Hubbletree cleared his throat loudly.

63
00:03:59.866 --> 00:04:03.409
Mr. Freaky looked stunned for a second, and then he beamed.

64
00:04:03.429 --> 00:04:05.570
"Mayor Hubbletree!

65
00:04:05.930 --> 00:04:07.371
I'm so glad you're here.

66
00:04:08.132 --> 00:04:10.714
Do you know anything about monster history?"

67
00:04:11.514 --> 00:04:14.456
Mr. Freaky and other monsters started talking again.

68
00:04:14.476 --> 00:04:19.059
"Not now, Freaky," said the mayor, looking uncomfortable.

69
00:04:19.079 --> 00:04:22.482
"I I owe you an apology.

70
00:04:23.222 --> 00:04:25.744
I learned that Dave accidentally caused the epidemic."

71
00:04:27.764 --> 00:04:29.925
"And that's not all," said Mrs.

72
00:04:29.965 --> 00:04:32.467
Hubbletree, giving her husband a stern look.

73
00:04:33.647 --> 00:04:35.208
The mayor grinned sheepishly.

74
00:04:35.228 --> 00:04:38.050
"No one is really sick at all.

75
00:04:38.850 --> 00:04:40.831
My wife says she feels fine.

76
00:04:41.211 --> 00:04:42.012
So does Dave."

77
00:04:43.192 --> 00:04:45.874
"We all feel fine too," said Mr.

78
00:04:45.914 --> 00:04:48.995
Freaky. "We're talkative but fine."

79
00:04:50.196 --> 00:04:53.858
"I'm not going to put up that concrete wall," said the mayor.

80
00:04:53.878 --> 00:04:56.700
"Wonderful!" said Mr.

81
00:04:56.740 --> 00:05:01.950
Freaky. "Now I really must tell you about Dave ran over to Jen.

82
00:05:01.970 --> 00:05:04.091
"Look! I'm purple!"

83
00:05:04.832 --> 00:05:05.612
Jen laughed.

84
00:05:06.833 --> 00:05:08.374
"We match!"

85
00:05:09.214 --> 00:05:10.875
Ben found Waldo in the crowd.

86
00:05:10.895 --> 00:05:15.237
"Guess what, buddy—your talk potion works!"

87
00:05:15.257 --> 00:05:19.100
"Better late than never," said Waldo with a grin.

88
00:05:20.120 --> 00:05:22.661
Then he started talking about his next experiment.

89
00:05:22.681 --> 00:05:26.884
"Ben! I'm sorry I didn't believe you."

90
00:05:27.836 --> 00:05:30.337
Winnie was hurrying toward him, talking fast.

91
00:05:30.357 --> 00:05:35.019
"I was just disappointed about the dance."

92
00:05:36.320 --> 00:05:39.421
She lowered her voice and flashed him a sympathetic smile.

93
00:05:39.441 --> 00:05:42.522
"And I read your mind about the walls.

94
00:05:43.263 --> 00:05:45.083
I didn't know you couldn't float through them."

95
00:05:45.103 --> 00:05:48.025
"Well, now I can do it!"

96
00:05:48.365 --> 00:05:49.065
boasted Ben.

97
00:05:49.085 --> 00:05:51.466
"At least some of the time.

98
00:05:51.786 --> 00:05:55.968
I kept trying to talk to you after the dance, Winnie, but I was too embarrassed, I guess.

99
00:05:57.356 --> 00:05:59.217
Now I can talk—and talk and talk!

100
00:06:00.457 --> 00:06:02.017
Do you have plans for Saturday night?"

101
00:06:03.638 --> 00:06:05.498
"Yes, I do," said Winnie.

102
00:06:05.518 --> 00:06:09.539
"Oh," said Ben, disappointed.

103
00:06:10.660 --> 00:06:11.440
Winnie laughed.

104
00:06:11.460 --> 00:06:14.341
"I have plans with you.

105
00:06:14.781 --> 00:06:15.701
Let's see a movie."

106
00:06:16.481 --> 00:06:17.282
Ben beamed.

107
00:06:17.302 --> 00:06:19.262
"That sounds great!"

108
00:06:20.703 --> 00:06:23.823
A few minutes later, Waldo's potion began to wear off.

109
00:06:24.484 --> 00:06:25.564
The talking stopped.

110
00:06:27.016 --> 00:06:31.381
Mrs. Hubbletree, Dave, and all the monsters returned to their normal colors.

111
00:06:32.383 --> 00:06:33.424
Everyone was happy.

112
00:06:34.185 --> 00:06:35.626
Well, almost everyone.

113
00:06:36.607 --> 00:06:37.989
Mrs. Hubbletree frowned.

114
00:06:38.009 --> 00:06:40.132
"I liked being purple!"
